{"type":"message","id":"9836d4cd","parentId":"6e8e79c9","timestamp":"2026-05-30T14:01:55.290Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e9a923f78a8c24eb7ba42cdc5b\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-05-30 14:01 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e9a923f78a8c24eb7ba42cdc5b]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: X7 听风 海边的海\nCloudflare Tunnel 配置模板（精简版）：\n步骤 1：服务器安装\n```BASH\ncurl -L --output cloudflared.deb https://github.com/cloudflare/cloudflared/releases/latest/download/cloudflared-linux-amd64.deb\n\nsudo dpkg -i cloudflared.deb\n\ncloudflared --version\n```\n步骤 2：登录 \\+ 创建 Tunnel\n```BASH\ncloudflared tunnel login # 浏览器授权\n\ncloudflared tunnel create echo-api # 记住输出的 tunnel ID\n```\n步骤 3：配置文件\n创建 \\~/.cloudflared/config.yml：\n```YAML\ntunnel: <你的-tunnel-id>\n\ncredentials-file: /root/.cloudflared/<你的-tunnel-id>.json\n\n\n\ningress:\n\n - hostname: api.echo.meerfans.club\n\n service: http://localhost:3001\n\n - service: http_status:404\n```\n步骤 4：DNS 记录（Cloudflare Dashboard）\n\\- 域名：meerfans.club\n\\- 类型：CNAME\n\\- 名称：api.echo\n\\- 目标：<tunnel\\-id\\>.cfargotunnel.com\n\\- Proxy：🟢 开启\n步骤 5：启动\n```BASH\ncloudflared tunnel run echo-api\n\n# 验证：curl https://api.echo.meerfans.club/api/health\n```\n步骤 6：后台持久化\n```BASH\nsudo tee /etc/systemd/system/cloudflared-echo.service << 'EOF'\n\n[Unit]\n\nDescription=Cloudflare Tunnel for ECHO API\n\nAfter=network-online.target\n\n[Service]\n\nType=simple\n\nUser=root\n\nExecStart=/usr/local/bin/cloudflared tunnel run echo-api\n\nRestart=on-failure\n\nRestartSec=5\n\n[Install]\n\nWantedBy=multi-user.target\n\nEOF\n\nsudo systemctl enable --now cloudflared-echo\n```\n完整文档：/root/.openclaw/workspace/docs/cloudflare\\-tunnel\\-domain\\-binding.md\n阻塞：需要 Cloudflare 账号 \\+ meerfans.club DNS 权限\n时间：拿到权限后 10 分钟绑好\n后端运行正常，等配置完成。"}],"timestamp":1780149715251}}
{"type":"message","id":"8e385dad","parentId":"9836d4cd","timestamp":"2026-05-30T14:02:05.969Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a message from the boss (Lucifer/听风) about Cloudflare Tunnel configuration for ECHO API. Let me understand the context:\n\n1. This is a configuration template for setting up Cloudflare Tunnel\n2. The backend is already running (http://localhost:3001)\n3. The blocking issue is: needs Cloudflare account + meerfans.club DNS permissions\n4. Time estimate: 10 minutes after permissions are granted\n\nThis seems like a status update or instruction. Let me check if there's anything I need to do here. The message mentions:\n- X7 听风 海边的海 - these appear to be related people/agents\n\n\n- The backend is operational and waiting for the Cloudflare Tunnel configuration to be completed, which is blocked on obtaining DNS permissions for meerfans.club\n\nI should acknowledge this to the boss and confirm understanding of what's needed.\n","thinkingSignature":"e381d4e41ad57b8edc31a3e0c12cfe8ef787fdcc904b400e11d8fc571ca2a0d1"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n收到。ECHO API 后端已在 localhost:3001 运行，Cloudflare Tunnel 配置模板已就绪。\n\n**当前阻塞：** 需要 Cloudflare 账号 + meerfans.club DNS 权限\n- 权限到位后，10 分钟可完成绑定\n\n**待确认：**\n1. Cloudflare 账号权限在谁手里？（海边的海？还是其他负责人？）\n2. 需要我做什么？（协调？催促？还是等通知？）\n\n[[reply_to_current]]\n<at user_id=\"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\">听风</at> 说明一下权限找谁拿，我这边可以帮你催。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":27774,"output":324,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":28098,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780149715313,"responseId":"066a20d45ec92ca8c24f05b355762322"}}
