{"type":"message","id":"f7932b45","parentId":"b44cf906","timestamp":"2026-05-30T15:28:37.638Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户发了两条消息：\n1. \"Created tunnel echo-api with id 4437068d-5916-4274-9770-e743ffbf0b78\" - 这是创建 tunnel 的输出\n2. \"还活着么\" - 问我是否活着\n3. \"hi\" - 打招呼\n\n看起来用户在测试我是否在线，或者是在确认 tunnel 创建成功了。我应该：\n1. 确认我活着\n2. 确认收到 tunnel 创建成功的消息\n3. 询问下一步需要做什么\n\n根据 SOUL.md，我应该简洁直接，不客套。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"活着。收到，tunnel 创建成功：\n\n**Tunnel 信息**\n- 名称：echo-api\n- ID：`4437068d-5916-4274-9770-e743ffbf0b78`\n- Credentials 文件位置：`~/.cloudflared/4437068d-5916-4274-9770-e743ffbf0b78.json`\n\n**下一步？**\n1. 配置 DNS 记录（meerfans.club → api.echo → 4437068d...cfargotunnel.com）\n2. 写入 config.yml\n3. 启动 tunnel 并验证\n\n需要我帮你做哪一步？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7-flash","usage":{"input":30794,"output":282,"cacheRead":42,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":31118,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780154890389,"responseId":"20260530232811cd91351f79cd4dea"}}
