{"type":"message","id":"07b1e828","parentId":"1a1fce14","timestamp":"2026-05-30T15:30:32.785Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户遇到了 SSL 握手失败的问题。错误信息：\n```\ncurl: (35) LibreSSL/3.3.6: error:1404B410:SSL routines:ST_CONNECT:sslv3 alert handshake failure\n```\n\n这个错误通常有几种可能：\n1. SSL/TLS 版本问题 - LibreSSL 3.3.6 可能不支持 TLS 1.2+，或者服务器配置有问题\n2. 证书问题 - Cloudflare tunnel 的证书可能还没签发，或者配置有问题\n3. 代理/防火墙问题\n\n让我先帮用户排查一下：\n1. 检查一下后端服务是否在运行\n2. 用 curl 的 -v 参数看详细错误\n3. 检查 tunnel 是否在运行\n4. 可能需要等一下 DNS 生效\n\n我应该先问清楚更多信息，然后给出排查步骤。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"SSL 握手失败，通常是证书或 TLS 版本问题。让我帮你排查：\n\n**先看详细错误**"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_7e25e41090d342619f985483","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -v https://api.echo.meerfans.club/api/health 2>&1 | head -30","host":"sandbox"},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"curl -v https://api.echo.meerfans.club/api/health 2>&1 | head -30\",\"host\":\"sandbox\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7-flash","usage":{"input":30982,"output":244,"cacheRead":87,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":31313,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780155017405,"responseId":"2026053023301802acfe71c62949ec"}}
